<Song resolves-to="SongSP" spName="SoDancoSamba-C-Theme" spTempo="108">
  <spVERSION>4</spVERSION>
  <spComments>Year:	1962
Composer:	Antônio Carlos Jobim
Lyricist:	Vinicius de Moraes; English lyrics
	by Norman Gimbel
Form:	32 bars  AABA
Style:	Bossa nova / samba
Key:	C major (common lead-sheet key)

Jobim and de Moraes wrote “Só Danço Samba” in 1962,
and João Gilberto and Os Cariocas first performed it in
Rio de Janeiro that August. The song is also known as
“Jazz ’n’ Samba”;</spComments>
